  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "html": "for 遍历的是东西，不是计数器"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Python 的 <code>for</code> 和 C 的 <code>for</code> 不是一回事。它遍历的是<strong>可迭代对象</strong>——列表、字符串、文件、生成器都行。需要下标时才用 <code>range</code>，而多数时候你并不需要下标。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "for 与 range"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c1",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "for i in range(3):\n    print(i)\n\nprint(list(range(1, 10, 3)))\nprint(list(range(5, 0, -2)))",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "0\n1\n2\n[1, 4, 7]\n[5, 3, 1]"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<code>range(start, stop, step)</code> 同样<strong>含头不含尾</strong>。<code>range(3)</code> 是 <code>0, 1, 2</code>，不含 3。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "遍历容器本身，比遍历下标更直接："
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c2",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "fruits = [\"apple\", \"banana\"]\n\nfor fruit in fruits:\n    print(fruit.upper())",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "APPLE\nBANANA"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "需要下标时用 <code>enumerate</code>，别写 <code>for i in range(len(fruits))</code>——第 14 课会展开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "while 与 break"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c3",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "n = 1\nwhile n < 100:\n    n *= 2\n\nprint(n)",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "128"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<code>while</code> 适合\"不知道要循环几次\"的场景。<code>break</code> 立刻跳出整个循环："
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c4",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "for n in [2, 4, 7, 8]:\n    if n % 2 == 1:\n        print(\"第一个奇数：\", n)\n        break",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "第一个奇数： 7"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<code>continue</code> 只跳过本轮剩下的语句，继续下一轮："
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c5",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "total = 0\nfor n in range(1, 6):\n    if n % 2 == 0:\n        continue\n    total += n\n\nprint(total)",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "9"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "1、3、5 相加得 9，偶数被跳过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "循环的 else：没被 break 才执行"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "这是 Python 独有、也最常被忽略的语法："
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c6",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "for n in [2, 4, 7]:\n    if n % 2 == 1:\n        print(\"发现奇数：\", n)\n        break\nelse:\n    print(\"没有奇数\")",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "发现奇数： 7"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "换一组全偶数的数据："
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c7",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "for n in [2, 4, 6]:\n    if n % 2 == 1:\n        break\nelse:\n    print(\"全是偶数\")",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "全是偶数"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<code>else</code> 在循环<strong>正常走完</strong>时执行，被 <code>break</code> 打断就不执行。它等价于\"没找到\"分支，比设一个 <code>found = False</code> 标志干净得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "callout",
      "kind": "tip",
      "title": "读法：for ... else 读作「找……，没找到就……」",
      "html": "这个名字起得不好，很多人以为是\"否则循环\"，其实是\"否则（没有 break）\"。记住这一点就不会用错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "question": "<code>for x in items: ... else: ...</code> 里的 else 什么时候执行？",
      "options": [
        "循环一次都没执行时",
        "循环被 break 打断时",
        "循环正常结束（没有被 break）时",
        "每次循环结束后都执行"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "explain": "else 分支只在循环自然走完时执行；只要遇到 break，else 就被跳过。它表达的是「没找到」这条路径。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "小结"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "<code>for</code> 遍历可迭代对象；<code>range</code> 含头不含尾，可指定步长与方向。",
        "<code>while</code> 用于循环次数未知的场景。",
        "<code>break</code> 跳出整个循环，<code>continue</code> 跳过本轮。",
        "<code>for/while ... else</code> 在\"没有被 break\"时执行，适合表达\"没找到\"。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "prev": "s0-11-conditionals",
